---
description: Testing
globs:
  - "**/*.test.ts"
  - "**/*.test.tsx"
  - e2e/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Unit: Vitest. E2E: Playwright against `astro preview` (port 4321).

Colocate unit tests in a `tests/` folder next to the module — same hierarchy as `hooks/` / `views/` / `models/`. Never `foo.test.ts` beside `foo.ts`.

```text
domain/basket/basket-total.ts
domain/basket/tests/basket-total.test.ts

features/basket-manage/tests/basket-store.test.ts
```

Test real behaviour: order status values, basket totals, checkout payload shape.

One smoke test per module is fine. Do not delete for being minimal.
